[1] https://github.com/9elements/qemu/commit/32139f913c2bd0ebe4bd26c46765861f6f9f2d49
[2] arch/arm/boot/dts/aspeed/aspeed-bmc-facebook-yosemite4.dts
[3] https://github.com/legoater/qemu-aspeed-boot/pull/5

